  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total Market Approach to Family Planning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Said/Ghana envisions providing assistance to a five (5) year activity to strengthen Ghanas total market approach to family planning (FP) with an emphasis on FP social marketing and private sector engagement activities. Assistance will direct resources to implement social marketing and private sector engagement for FP services to contribute to FP2030 country commitments.</narrative>
  </description>
